{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/456180/extras/46a2efb5ddd8740fd92474d9eadcbb03.avif?t=1747868753\" width=600 height=121 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Samurai Punk presents The American Dream, a satirical virtual reality trip to a \u2018brighter future\u2019 where your everyday needs are solved with guns. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/456180/extras/07bae19354dc8582d6de5d1577093107.poster.avif?t=1747868753\" width=602 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/456180/extras/07bae19354dc8582d6de5d1577093107.webm?t=1747868753\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/456180/extras/07bae19354dc8582d6de5d1577093107.mp4?t=1747868753\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's the 1950\u2019s and a group of leading gun manufacturers have constructed a vast complex to guide the American Patriot towards a better and richer life. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/456180/extras/7dd8090fb20baa4a586f81b342a925be.poster.avif?t=1747868753\" width=602 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/456180/extras/7dd8090fb20baa4a586f81b342a925be.webm?t=1747868753\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/456180/extras/7dd8090fb20baa4a586f81b342a925be.mp4?t=1747868753\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the talking dog Buddy Washington as your guide, you'll get to experience what it's like to live all aspects of your life with guns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/456180/extras/3427d4f4d2a4c6eedfc194e517416c5c.webp?t=1747868753\" width=600 height=53 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully-voiced, single player, narrative-driven campaign with over 20 unique levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn how guns can help improve the key moments of your life as an Average American.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience immersive, interactive environments ready to meet the business end of your weapons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A host of lovingly crafted firearms including pistols, shotguns, SMGs and tactical sporting rifles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bullets.<br>  </p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Begin The Cycle","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/456180/496064e910c4d94551092be9dd8466a23edc72f5.jpg"},{"name":"Baby's Got a Gun","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/456180/496064e910c4d94551092be9dd8466a23edc72f5.jpg"},{"name":"Rising Star Award","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/456180/496064e910c4d94551092be9dd8466a23edc72f5.jpg"},{"name":"Heartbreak","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/456180/496064e910c4d94551092be9dd8466a23edc72f5.jpg"},{"name":"Carnival Pleasures","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/456180/496064e910c4d94551092be9dd8466a23edc72f5.jpg"},{"name":"Royale With Cheese","path":"https://cdn.akamai.